  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "The cough began on Tuesday, so that's four days now. It was dry at first, and then I started bringing up yellowy-green phlegm, mostly first thing.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:15",
      "end_timestamp": "01:28",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint",
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "family_member",
      "transcript_text": "What worries me is her breathing. She's breathless just walking to the lounge, and that's new. She used to do the whole corridor.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:47",
      "end_timestamp": "01:59",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "No fuss, just an honest picture. Have you had a temperature, any shivers?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:16",
      "end_timestamp": "02:23",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No, no fever. The nurse took it on Wednesday and it was normal.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:25",
      "end_timestamp": "02:32",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Good. And any pain in the chest when you cough or breathe in?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:33",
      "end_timestamp": "02:39",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No chest pain. The ribs are sore from coughing, but nothing sharp.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:41",
      "end_timestamp": "02:46",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "All right, that's useful. What about your tummy and appetite, any trouble with eating, or your bowels?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:49",
      "end_timestamp": "02:58",
      "supports": [
        "review_of_systems[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "All fine there. I'm eating my toast.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:00",
      "end_timestamp": "03:04",
      "supports": [
        "review_of_systems[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "family_member",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, here. Ramipril 5 mg once a day, and metformin 500 mg twice a day, and the water tablet in the morning, I don't have the name written.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:20",
      "end_timestamp": "03:33",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]",
        "medications[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Twice a day, every day. Breakfast and tea. I'm very regular about it.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:45",
      "end_timestamp": "03:52",
      "supports": [
        "medications[1]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "family_member",
      "transcript_text": "Mum, the night carer told me you push the evening one away quite often. She said it half the week.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:54",
      "end_timestamp": "04:03",
      "supports": [
        "medications[1]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Type 2 diabetes, hence the metformin. High blood pressure. And arthritis in the hands, which is why my handwriting is so poor.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:29",
      "end_timestamp": "04:39",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Your handwriting is perfectly clear, I can see the notebook. Now a question I always ask, any allergies?",
      "start_timestamp": "04:40",
      "end_timestamp": "04:50",
      "supports": [
        "allergies[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "family_member",
      "transcript_text": "That's one I'm not sure about. Years ago she came out in something after an antibiotic, but nobody can remember which one, or what it did. It might have been an allergy, it might not.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:52",
      "end_timestamp": "05:09",
      "supports": [
        "allergies[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "So possibly allergic to an antibiotic, but no name and no clear reaction. I'll record it as uncertain, and we'll try to trace the old records.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:20",
      "end_timestamp": "05:33",
      "supports": [
        "allergies[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I want to see a picture before I say anything definite. I'd like to send you for a chest X-ray today, at the hospital over the road.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:39",
      "end_timestamp": "06:52",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Perfect. In the meantime, plenty of fluids, sit up in the armchair rather than lying flat, and let the carers know if the breathing gets harder.",
